        <mxCell id="rules" value="KEY RULES&#10;Online and face-to-face are meeting-method branches, not the two separate appointment business workflows.&#10;Booking uses shared calendar availability and validation. Private file uploads require the permitted signed-in path.&#10;A meeting link is not evidence that a consultation happened. Custom-product work is separately tracked in F10." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#273142;fontFamily=Montserrat;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
